{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"X\",\"nets\":{\"big\":\"X\",\"small\":\"Y\",\"core\":\"X\",\"concise\":\"X\",\"human\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\",\"load\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"big：X 的大块直接交代当屏的状态、原因和体验，Y 只看高亮短语时，部分屏需要依赖未高亮的连接语才能补全因果。small：Y 的补充通常更贴合当屏的关系推进，X 有些感受与大块表达重复；core：X 更持续地围绕亲密当下的满足与无法留住它的酸楚展开，Y 后段较多转向被需要、互相依靠和害怕被嫌弃的关系焦虑。concise：X 虽也有同屏近义表达，但 Y 多次跨屏重复对方没有退开、自己不再隐藏喜欢、希望长期相处等信息；human：Y 的日常口语更自然，X 的“接收其中的快乐”“把这份感觉推得更满”“念头刚安静又冒出算了”等搭配比较生硬。fine：X 的感受更多落在身体和情绪体验上，具体且有辨识度，Y 的感受块则经常转向歌声、声部和音乐变化；load：Y 的高亮短语较短，X 多屏有数个较长的大块，扫读压力更大。 \"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "08b0a5c1-c99b-4246-a488-686b5a4b0776", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T090530467382Z", "elapsed_seconds": 430.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T09:12:41.211004+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f5237150378c5050417b247b39d31baab53d688fe52730a5a92a16ab1bfb1568", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed